,"text":"いつのまにか湯船に誘拐","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":121.28,"end":122.67,"text":"バイトして手に入れたタブレット","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":122.67,"end":124.75,"text":"なぁ兄弟？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":124.75,"end":125.9,"text":"それな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":125.9,"end":127.33,"text":"壊れてねーからいいじゃん","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":127.33,"end":128.64,"text":"てかアンタだけとかずるいじゃん","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":128.64,"end":131.86,"text":"貸すのはいいよ ひとつ約束な","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":131.86,"end":135.0,"text":"無茶しないでくれませんか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":135.0,"end":137.48,"text":"モノを大事にできますか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":137.48,"end":138.0,"text":"ハァ？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":138.0,"end":140.99,"text":"なんで？なんで？わけわっかんねーよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":140.99,"end":144.06,"text":"認めなさいな がさつなとこ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":144.06,"end":146.15,"text":"やはり早すぎたか 猫に小判","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":146.15,"end":149.99,"text":"指一本も（ハァ？）触れさせぬ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":149.99,"end":153.09,"text":"ちょいな ちょいな ちょっとだけいいじゃん","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":153.09,"end":156.03,"text":"遺言はそれだけか 外道め","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":156.03,"end":158.4,"text":"どうしてもアノ世がみたいのか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":158.4,"end":161.96,"text":"泣き叫べ 覚悟はいいか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":161.96,"end":164.99,"text":"くすぐりぢごくの刑 きゃはは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":164.99,"end":170.87,"text":"潮時まちがえて本気モードになるのは禁止です","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":170.87,"end":173.29,"text":"波動に昇龍拳","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":173.29,"end":188.94,"text":"十六文キック こけし かめはめは",